Here's my $.02:

	Maze levels standardly appear before hell.  In my experience, the
order has been around 25 normals, Medusa level, some mazes, Castle level,
and then hell (with the first 3 being "Bad Vlad's Tower").  I have also seen
normal levels pop up between Medusa and the Castle.  I don't have a clue as to
how normal levels seem to have popped up in hell, though.

	I also compiled NetHack 3.0j for an IBM RS/6000 (AIX).  I did it
once with TEXTCOLOR off and once with it on.  No color appeared, though.  The
only discernable difference was that with TEXTCOLOR on and the STANDOUT
option on, items appeared highlighted in addition to monsters.

	By the way, if you ever have a problem with garbled inventories on
your RS/6000, there is a patch at linc.cis.upenn.edu in the PC directory that
should fix it (change MSDOS's to UNIX's).  I mention this because it happened
on the machine I use.  Thanks to everyone who pointed this fix out!

